Nuschl modifications (2026-11-11): replace base64-simd with base64 0.22; replace
icy_sixel/quantette with an exact adaptive palette for <=256 colors and otherwise
color_quant 1.1.0 NeuQuant; checked dimensions/exact RGBA length, bounded encoded
output and safe number formatting. Keep ratatui-image 11.1's public widget APIs
and SIXEL raster/band/transparency/slicing format. The no-longer-used SIXEL
source-format decoder and SIMD quantizer implementation are not included.
NeuQuant supplies an adaptive palette, not a fixed 3-3-2 color cube. Upstream
binary alpha semantics remain; callers should precompose partial alpha against
the intended background to preserve formula antialiasing.

color_quant 1.1.0 is an existing MIT-licensed dependency (Piston Developers);
its source and license remain with that dependency, rather than copied here.
